content:
🌎💃 The world dances in Odessa!

Experience colorful cultural dances—one of the highlights of our International Cultural Festival! See the flyer for our current lineup, plus a special Navajo Nation blessing ceremony.

📅 Saturday, October 24, 2026 | 4–7 PM
📍 Odessa College Downtown Greenspace

Want to represent your culture through dance? Message us to join the lineup!

Bring your family and celebrate with us! 🎉
City of Odessa, Texas
Odessa College Hispanic Heritage of Odessa International Student Club- UTPB
